f Metis.<br /> <br /> The Tribes that tend to accept unwanted Metis take them as children so they can be raised in the values of their adopted Tribe, not as adults.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T02:30:29-07:00","id":1107951,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107949#post1107949\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Again, you're assuming that the &quot;nicer&quot; groups will just take you. Tribes get to say no. Tribal Totems get to say no. If Unicorn or Rat don't think you're right for their Tribe, they don't have to let the Rite of Initiation to work just because the Children of Gaia and Bonegnawers tend to be accepting of Metis.<br /> <br /> The Tribes that tend to accept unwanted Metis take them as children so they can be raised in the values of their adopted Tribe, not as adults.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Well I know that tribes who turn down warriors are going to shoot themselves in the paw. Also, a Garou who allows himself to be bullied is going to be dishonoring himself.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T02:43:30-07:00","id":1107953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107837#post1107837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mind you, leaving the Fianna to join the Children of Gaia may cause you to lose respect with the Fianna but they were never going to respect you anyway.<br /> <br /> So fuck em.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, it might save -you-, but what about the metis who come after you? What about those children who get to deal with beating and starvation and constant emotional abuse just because of their birth. Now added to by you proving you could not handle the tribe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T03:37:07-07:00","id":1107960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107951#post1107951\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I know that tribes who turn down warriors are going to shoot themselves in the paw. Also, a Garou who allows himself to be bullied is going to be dishonoring himself.</div> </div> </div> </div>Great, so you've covered why there are still active and functioning Metis in every Tribe; even the most abusive like the Fianna and Silver Fangs. They can't afford to let their Metis go to waste even if they don't like them.<br /> <br /> You've also covered why plenty of Metis don't leave their Tribes even if they're treated like shit: that's allowing themselves to be bullied. A Fianna Metis that flees to another Tribe just allowed themselves to be bullied into doing exactly what the abusive type Fianna want: proving that Metis can't cut it. Metis that don't want to be bullied to maintain their honor don't run away from their problems. They fight for respect even harder to show they're even more deserving of it.<br /> <br /> You're also flagrantly ignoring tons of how Garou culture is portrayed. The higher ranked Garou have a tendency towards bullying everyone between building up Rage, pride in their accomplishments, the Litany supporting their place in the hierarchy, and things like being able to just deny lower ranking Garou challenges at all. Cubs, Cliaths, and Fostern dealing with the higher Ranks letting shit roll down hill is something all Garou are generally presented as dealing with. Not just the Metis.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T04:43:00-07:00","id":1107971,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107960#post1107960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Great, so you've covered why there are still active and functioning Metis in every Tribe; even the most abusive like the Fianna and Silver Fangs. They can't afford to let their Metis go to waste even if they don't like them.<br /> <br /> You've also covered why plenty of Metis don't leave their Tribes even if they're treated like shit: that's allowing themselves to be bullied. A Fianna Metis that flees to another Tribe just allowed themselves to be bullied into doing exactly what the abusive type Fianna want: proving that Metis can't cut it. Metis that don't want to be bullied to maintain their honor don't run away from their problems. They fight for respect even harder to show they're even more deserving of it.<br /> <br /> You're also flagrantly ignoring tons of how Garou culture is portrayed. The higher ranked Garou have a tendency towards bullying everyone between building up Rage, pride in their accomplishments, the Litany supporting their place in the hierarchy, and things like being able to just deny lower ranking Garou challenges at all. Cubs, Cliaths, and Fostern dealing with the higher Ranks letting shit roll down hill is something all Garou are generally presented as dealing with. Not just the Metis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, Heavy Arms I've described why Garou society is tearing itself apart.<br /> <br /> Which canon describes all the time.<br /> <br /> Everyone hates everyone.<br /> <br /> You're assuming there's some kind of Metis hive-mind which means every one is going to act the same way. Some Metis are going to try to win the respect of the Fianna and Silver Fangs. Some will be loyal because they're family and you don't betray your blood ties, no matter what. Others will murder the Fianna who abuse them if they're strong enough in challenges or at the very least bloody themselves as much as possible. Others will renounce their tribe and find better lives in the Children of Gaia or even Bonegnawers.<br /> <br /> It depends on the Garou.<br /> <br /> The idea of &quot;cutting and running&quot; is a charge which is going to not fly, though. Yeah, you may take an honor hit but if a Rank 1 Fianna Homid says that about a Rank 4 Metis then said Metis cuts him apart--because Garou society is all about what you've earned and bullying the guy under you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-26-2017, 07:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T05:11:45-07:00","id":1107975,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107971#post1107971\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Actually, Heavy Arms I've described why Garou society is tearing itself apart.<br /> <br /> Which canon describes all the time.<br /> <br /> Everyone hates everyone.<br /> <br /> You're assuming there's some kind of Metis hive-mind which means every one is going to act the same way. Some Metis are going to try to win the respect of the Fianna and Silver Fangs. Some will be loyal because they're family and you don't betray your blood ties, no matter what. Others will murder the Fianna who abuse them if they're strong enough in challenges or at the very least bloody themselves as much as possible. Others will renounce their tribe and find better lives in the Children of Gaia or even Bonegnawers.<br /> <br /> It depends on the Garou.<br /> <br /> The idea of &quot;cutting and running&quot; is a charge which is going to not fly, though. Yeah, you may take an honor hit but if a Rank 1 Fianna Homid says that about a Rank 4 Metis then said Metis cuts him apart--because Garou society is all about what you've earned and bullying the guy under you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thing is, if this metis makes and kills that many non-metis garou, the other metis in the tribal sept will suffer from it. That is something that most metis would be very aware, since they possibly grew up in the same sept. There will always be new ones, and if you fuck things up, they will pay the price more than you do.<br /> <br /> And that is assuming the metis gets away with cutting apart a cliath homid. Especially among the Fianna, the Elders would try to find a way to punish the metis for daring to kill a homid.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T05:28:52-07:00","id":1107979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107975#post1107975\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Thing is, if this metis makes and kills that many non-metis garou, the other metis in the tribal sept will suffer from it. That is something that most metis would be very aware, since they possibly grew up in the same sept. There will always be new ones, and if you fuck things up, they will pay the price more than you do.<br /> <br /> And that is assuming the metis gets away with cutting apart a cliath homid. Especially among the Fianna, the Elders would try to find a way to punish the metis for daring to kill a homid.</div> </div> </div> </div>Mind you, if the Fianna end up killing a high ranking Metis then that causes its own problems.<br /> <br /> And they should be focused on the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> I basically use Game of Thrones acknowledged bastards as my litmus test for how Metis are tolerated. They're allowed to bear arms, can rise quite high in the septs service, but will never QUITE be equals.<br /> <br /> And they will never let their parents' sins be forgotten.<br /> <br /> Nevertheless, it's a mistake to try and just dismiss them or assume attacking them will go unpunished as they have family--even if it's not their blood.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T05:59:59-07:00","id":1108001,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1107979#post1107979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Mind you, if the Fianna end up killing a high ranking Metis then that causes its own problems.<br /> <br /> And they should be focused on the Wyrm.<br /> <br /> I basically use Game of Thrones acknowledged bastards as my litmus test for how Metis are tolerated. They're allowed to bear arms, can rise quite high in the septs service, but will never QUITE be equals.<br /> <br /> And they will never let their parents' sins be forgotten.<br /> <br /> Nevertheless, it's a mistake to try and just dismiss them or assume attacking them will go unpunished as they have family--even if it's not their blood.</div> </div> </div> </div>Not if they dress it up as a justified thing, due to the metis Taking Action that Causes the Caern to be Violated, or made others Suffer for Their Sickness. The tribe has kept this behaviour for much much longer than Westerosi has had its current system. That is kinda the scary thing about the Fianna or the Silver Fangs in that, they have Ways to deal with uppity metis.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T06:15:13-07:00","id":1108009,"title":"","content":"Exactly how many Metis does everyone think exists in the Garou Nation? I generally think that there are 15,000 members of the Garou Nation (with another 15,000 Garou divided among the Ahadi, Beast Courts, BSD, Independents, and Ronin), and I really do not see the Metis being more than 1% of the Garou Nation. The majority of Metis are probably going to leave the Garou Nation to become Ronin or to join the BSD (which probably is fifty percent Metis).<br /> <br /> With an estimated population of 3,000 members, the BSD would have 1,500 Metis (the Homid and the Lupus members mate with anything they can hold down long enough). The ubiquity of Metis among the BSD would reinforce the distrust of the Garou Nation against the Metis because they would see them as potential Ronin at best and future BSD at worst. A good number of the potential mothers in modern times would probably get an abortion to avoid the shame of bearing a child who would likely end up serving the Wyrm (with discrete Kinfolk doctors and veterinarians being in high demand).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T07:25:38-07:00","id":1108020,"title":"","content":"I generally think of the Garou Nation as 70% Homid, 20% Metis, and 10% Lupus. Certainly, there's more Metis than Lupus and they are a major source of warriors as well as people involved in their life. Their ubiquity also something that seems to be another sign of the Apocalypse but also perhaps why the Garou Nation hasn't fallen.<br /> <br /> As for Garou, I put them about half as many vampires in the world so about 50,000. All of the Fera put together being about the same as the Garou as a whole.<br /> <br /> The big advantage to Metis being they are born Garou every time and that has a major boon over their kinfolk.<br /> <br /> But I admit, our different perspectives do explain a few of our arguments as I think there's almost 20 times as many Metis in my games as in yours. This is where Storyteller's prerogative can lead to very different perspectives and social roles. In your games, Metis are incredibly rare and something you'd only seen one at a massive gathering of Garou or at a huge sept like the New York one.<br /> <br /> For me, they're as common as every other pack having one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-26-2017, 10:35 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T08:29:28-07:00","id":1108036,"title":"","content":"20% Metis? That would require 50% of the non-Metis to break the first prohibition of the Litany (assuming one Metis cub per pair of diddling Garou). I really cannot imagine anyone taking the Litany seriously if that many people are violating the first prohibition.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T12:49:44-07:00","id":1108112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108009#post1108009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly how many Metis does everyone think exists in the Garou Nation? I generally think that there are 15,000 members of the Garou Nation (with another 15,000 Garou divided among the Ahadi, Beast Courts, BSD, Independents, and Ronin), and I really do not see the Metis being more than 1% of the Garou Nation. The majority of Metis are probably going to leave the Garou Nation to become Ronin or to join the BSD (which probably is fifty percent Metis).<br /> <br /> With an estimated population of 3,000 members, the BSD would have 1,500 Metis (the Homid and the Lupus members mate with anything they can hold down long enough). The ubiquity of Metis among the BSD would reinforce the distrust of the Garou Nation against the Metis because they would see them as potential Ronin at best and future BSD at worst. A good number of the potential mothers in modern times would probably get an abortion to avoid the shame of bearing a child who would likely end up serving the Wyrm (with discrete Kinfolk doctors and veterinarians being in high demand).</div> </div> </div> </div>Generally, I think there are a little more lupus than metis, simply because lupus do breed much faster than garou or humans. But as for where they are by nation/ronin/BSDs...<br /> <br /> First of all, most metis will not become ronin out of their own will. No matter how harsh the treatment, at least they ARE part of a pack, they have some social connection there. Ronin are essentially lone wolves, there is a reason death is favoured over becoming a ronin among the garou. A metis will fight claw and nail for their place in a society, rather than leave it and be alone. Especially since metis do -not- often have anywhere else to go.<br /> <br /> As for BSDs, as much as they breed metis, I'd say they actually do put breeding in such a high importance that most of their own metis are happiest being shock troops for the Wyrm. They will accept Gaian metis, sure. But I highly doubt most would, it is seriously a massive change of mentality there.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T13:35:10-07:00","id":1108129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108009#post1108009\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Exactly how many Metis does everyone think exists in the Garou Nation?</div> </div> </div> </div>We've had this discussion on here before. I usually put the Homid borns around 80-85% at this point (since the books themselves disagree on the exact number). Then around 10-15% Lupus and 3-8% Metis. Exact numbers aren't ever necessary for any particular game so I don't overly worry about it. <br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108020#post1108020\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I generally think of the Garou Nation as 70% Homid, 20% Metis, and 10% Lupus. Certainly, there's more Metis than Lupus and they are a major source of warriors as well as people involved in their life. Their ubiquity also something that seems to be another sign of the Apocalypse but also perhaps why the Garou Nation hasn't fallen.<br /> <br /> As for Garou, I put them about half as many vampires in the world so about 50,000. All of the Fera put together being about the same as the Garou as a whole.</div> </div> </div> </div>So if these numbers work for your games then awesome. They are really far off of canon though, if that matters.<br /> <br /> 50,000 Garou is ridiculously high. And Garou numbers most certainly do not equal all other Fera combined when the Ratkin and Ananasi have about the same or more populations each.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108112#post1108112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> Generally, I think there are a little more lupus than metis, simply because lupus do breed much faster than garou or humans.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree the Lupus population should outnumber the Metis. Though the closer and closer the Apocalypse comes, they are probably getting closer and closer since Lupus are dying out in general (at a much faster rate than Garou as a whole).<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108112#post1108112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> But as for where they are by nation/ronin/BSDs...<br /> <br /> First of all, most metis will not become ronin out of their own will. No matter how harsh the treatment, at least they ARE part of a pack, they have some social connection there. Ronin are essentially lone wolves, there is a reason death is favoured over becoming a ronin among the garou. A metis will fight claw and nail for their place in a society, rather than leave it and be alone. Especially since metis do -not- often have anywhere else to go.</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it's also important to add that while we the readers know (or think) that Metis have options for places to go, the individual Metis characters almost certainly do not. It has probably never occurred to the majority of them that there would be any place to go. As stated, they are raised completely within Tribal structured society. A particular Metis might be unhappy with their lot in life, but I don't think it's going to be a regular occurrence to try and petition another Tribe for acceptance, even under some of the worst of circumstances.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://drive.google.com/uc?export=view&amp;id=0B9RzepSqCby3Mi1KUmJ5aWUwRVk\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/805-idpersona","name":"idpersona","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar805_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T13:42:34-07:00","id":1108132,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lin Liren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction#post1107244\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is a rather large contradiction in the very <i>existence</i> of Metis Philodox in Garou Society.</div> </div> </div> </div>And yet Gaia has set aside Gifts that not only are easier for Metis to acquire than other Garou, some can only be used by Metis...almost as if she intended for there to be a place in the Nation for the blameless offspring of such a blasphemous union.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T15:06:09-07:00","id":1108161,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108036#post1108036\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">20% Metis? That would require 50% of the non-Metis to break the first prohibition of the Litany (assuming one Metis cub per pair of diddling Garou). I really cannot imagine anyone taking the Litany seriously if that many people are violating the first prohibition.</div> </div> </div> </div>The 20% ratio does include Black Spiral Dancerst. Others are from Garou who simply do not believe it's wrong or have their own packs covering for them.<br /> Matings with Garou are 10 times more effective at producing Garou than matings with kinfolk. Metis are also people who mature far faster and grow up in the septs. As for not taking the Litany seriously, the whole point is that it's constantly being violated and the Garou are suffering for it. Or maybe it's a good thing as, again, the prohibition isn't necessarily right.<br /> <br /> The idea it's 1% isn't remotely substantiated by the number of Metis NPCs in canon.<br /> <br /> As for 15,000, that is a number which I find ridiculous for the power structures of the Garou and complex politics described in the game plus multiple factions as well as the fact the Garou are a worldwide phenomenon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-26-2017, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T18:43:01-07:00","id":1108209,"title":"","content":"The numbers from the books don't work. We all know this. The original WW sucked at putting out numbers that make sense. Though it's worth noting that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11683_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11683\" data-vbnamecard=\"11683\">Aya Tari</a> assumes 30,000 Garou world wide, not 15,000. 15,000 are the members of the Garou Nation, with the other half being the BSDs, Beast Courts, etc. You seem to be talking about 50,000 as including those groups too.<br /> <br /> That said <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> I'm really completely lost at what you're trying to say regarding the core topic. Besides getting swept into the numbers-which-don't-make-sense debate, after your few two posts, you just seem to be getting contrarian without a real point to what you're trying get across. You counter points with some grand assertion, and then when that gets challenged, you seem to just try to poke holes. There doesn't seem to be a real point being pushed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T19:53:38-07:00","id":1108236,"title":"","content":"For what it is worth, I generally think that the population of the Fera should probably be equal to the population of the vampires (both KJ and Kindred), with a global population of around 150,000. In the case of the Fera, the Ananasi, Garou, Ratkin, and Rokea should each probably make up 20% of the population, meaning that the Rokea were nearly as common as the land Fera before their numbers were devastated by the testing of the hydrogen bomb, and the rest of the Fera dividing the remaining 20% (the majority of whom are Bastet, Corax, Kitsune, and Mokole, with the Ajaba, Gurahl, Nagah, and Nuwisha being rounding errors). In the case of the vampires, I like making the KJ population equal to the Kindred population, but that is just me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11683,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","user":"Aya Tari","date":". 06-26-2017, 11:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T20:35:57-07:00","id":1108248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108209#post1108209\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The numbers from the books don't work. We all know this. The original WW sucked at putting out numbers that make sense. Though it's worth noting that <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar11683_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"11683\" data-vbnamecard=\"11683\">Aya Tari</a> assumes 30,000 Garou world wide, not 15,000. 15,000 are the members of the Garou Nation, with the other half being the BSDs, Beast Courts, etc. You seem to be talking about 50,000 as including those groups too.</div> </div> </div> </div>My bad.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> That said <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> I'm really completely lost at what you're trying to say regarding the core topic. Besides getting swept into the numbers-which-don't-make-sense debate, after your few two posts, you just seem to be getting contrarian without a real point to what you're trying get across. You counter points with some grand assertion, and then when that gets challenged, you seem to just try to poke holes. There doesn't seem to be a real point being pushed. </div> </div> </div>My general point is that Metis are subject to a lot of social pressure and derision but they're not at a point where they're waning in their power, they're waxing in their power and they're doing that due to the fact the Metis have grown in numbers to the largest they've ever been and also by being mean rather than subservient. Fights with Honor didn't get any respect by being a subservient Garou, he got it by killing things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T22:28:21-07:00","id":1108280,"title":"","content":"Yes, the couple hundred Metis who are not aborted or drowned at birth in modern times are making Metis more accepted in the Garou Nation. I doubt that they are that common though, as you need two Garou willing to break the Litany to produce a Metis. Most Garou will probably just have sex with a few dozen of the hundreds of thousands of willing and eager Human Kinfolk instead of breaking the Litany.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11683-aya-tari","name":"Aya Tari","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11683_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-26T23:04:23-07:00","id":1108292,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Aya Tari</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108280#post1108280\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, the couple hundred Metis who are not aborted or drowned at birth in modern times are making Metis more accepted in the Garou Nation. I doubt that they are that common though, as you need two Garou willing to break the Litany to produce a Metis. Most Garou will probably just have sex with a few dozen of the hundreds of thousands of willing and eager Human Kinfolk instead of breaking the Litany.</div> </div> </div> </div>Garou being the fundamentalist crazy people obsessed with creating new Garou are probably generally all for any new births even if they're dirty dirty Metis. As for the Garou willing to break the Litany, the simple fact is Garou are going to be closer to one another all the time. Sex with kinfolk is fine but Garou rarely have any sort of relationship with them. The books themselves say they need to seek out comfort and the only people who understand are fellow Garou.<br /> <br /> The Litany may forbid Garou-Garou relations but most religions forbid a lot of sexual activity that isn't remotely stopped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-27T02:35:04-07:00","id":1108322,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1107244-metis-philodox-contradiction?p=1108129#post1108129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it's also important to add that while we the readers know (or think) that Metis have options for places to go, the individual Metis characters almost certainly do not. It has probably never occurred to the majority of them that there would be any place to go. As stated, they are raised completely within Tribal structured society. A particular Metis might be unhappy with their lot in life, but I don't think it's going to be a regular occurrence to try and petition another Tribe for acceptance, even under some of the worst of circumstances.</div> </div> </div> </div>In general, I think people severly overestimatimate how easy it is for metis to fit in with the human society. They might have had the basic 'how to not break the veil' education, but outside that it is not easy to just go from a community to the city or even suburbs. And if they leave, they might not have kinfolk there to aid them.<br /> <br /> Thing like;<br /> - Getting a job. Even if it is off the tables, a metis doesn't often have the knowledge how to actually apply. Nevermind the social models in the workplace, having grown up with the system of beatings and provings.<br /> <br /> - General social behaviour, if a metis leaves due to being a runt and due to beatings, think how easily they would submit or apologise. And on the other hand, thinking that a beating would solve their issues. This is ignoring just the plain fact that these people have been raised to respect nature in a waaay more intense way than most people.<br /> <br /> -What is money?<br /> <br /> - Renting an apartment, or the concept of 'borrowed space' in general. Unless they'd just hide in abandoned houses.<br /> <br /> - Proper hygiene as seen by humans.<br /> <br /> -Ironically, possibly they'd be very ableist towards fellow disabled people, given they themselves were insulted by it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}